{"id":51268,"date":"2026-05-14T06:43:22","date_gmt":"2026-05-14T05:43:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51268"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:34:12","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:34:12","slug":"trail-do-paimouro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-paimouro\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Paimouro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Paimouro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Paimouro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>3 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica vila de <strong>Canas de Senhorim<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Nelas<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva e Cultural Anti Social Social Run Club<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Canas de Senhorim<\/strong> e do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Nelas<\/strong>, o evento convida os apaixonados pelo trail running a explorar os trilhos verdes da regi\u00e3o vin\u00edcola do D\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A jornada desportiva oferece tr\u00eas percursos distintos: o <strong>Trail Longo (26 km com 1000m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto (16 km com 600m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h15<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>. Repleto de paisagens buc\u00f3licas, ribeiras e pinhais frondosos, o evento inclui t-shirt oficial, medalha finisher para todos os finalistas, abastecimentos completos e op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o-conv\u00edvio p\u00f3s-prova.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"di